{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4010780/extras/7ab7a97054ff244dbfa26b22b7a274c6.avif?t=1763900857\" width=1117 height=217 /></span>OLYEN is a first-person puzzle and exploration game set in a forgotten valley once inhabited by four sages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across ruins, mechanisms, and\u00a0impossible structures, you\u2019ll uncover their scattered writings notes, diaries, and reports that piece together a non-linear story of knowledge, ambition, and loss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle in OLYEN is part of a larger mechanism. As you explore, you\u2019ll observe how each element connects to the whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to evoke curiosity and calm, OLYEN invites you to slow down, look closely, and experience the quiet satisfaction of discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey lasts around three hours, offering a compact yet atmospheric experience focused on observation, logic, and the joy of finding meaning in a forgotten world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Templo Erigido","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010780/6f691a7a315568e8641391f9a82f4dc65ce29063.jpg"},{"name":"Torre","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010780/2e745b4aca97ac19592dc5841a9a62c8ae769c5b.jpg"},{"name":"Piedras","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010780/d8a1d19a99b6c4c01c00bda9f23a70530570c8bd.jpg"},{"name":"Karteria","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010780/2ce00a78a8b36a780d97fed9db3d144797c660a5.jpg"},{"name":"Jardines","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4010780/7ebc345c15dbd9051974acd4dcaac5cd62b7395c.jpg"},{"name":"Flores","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/